{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967630/extras/90s.png?t=1748948099\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What boots up is an <u>UNDISCOVERED GEM</u>. A fun, funny point and click adventure that somehow merges <i>Monkey Island</i>, <i>Office Space</i>, and a smidge of <i>Metal Gear Solid</i>.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In The Biggleboss Incident, you\u2019ll solve puzzles, shirk responsibility, and figure out what\u2019s really happening behind the scenes in the world\u2019s weirdest office.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967630/extras/labgif3.gif?t=1748948099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s just like those adventure games you remember, only without the insane moon logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967630/extras/divider.png?t=1748948099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967630/extras/story.png?t=1748948099\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>There is NOTHING sinister happening at Biggleboss Inc.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or at least that\u2019s what the company motto says. Tom doesn\u2019t have time to debate semantics, though; he\u2019s dangerously late for work \u2013 and he hasn\u2019t even started his big Project AGER pitch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sneaking up to his desk won\u2019t be easy. In his way stands a boatload of bureaucracy, a furlong of fetch quests, and a pretty ominous set of warnings from a mysterious voice in the air vents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967630/extras/toiletgif3.gif?t=1748948099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just what is going on at Biggleboss Inc.?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What does it have to do with Tom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And why does it suddenly feel like his day is only set to get weirder?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967630/extras/divider.png?t=1748948099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967630/extras/voice_acting.png?t=1748948099\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>This game is fully voiced by real human beings who all got paid.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That's 13 actors playing some 18 characters. Why not see if you can guess which ones double up? I bet you can't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;This is the first script  I've recorded where I have genuinely laughed out loud all throughout the recording. In my 11 years of working as a voice actor I'd mark this down as <strong>the funniest project I've ever worked on</strong>.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0- <strong>Greg Johnson</strong> | The game's lead voice actor</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game's also packed with  lots of whizzy animations, cutscenes, and fun touches that took ages to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In fact this whole thing took me five years to make, so if you play it I sure hope you like it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967630/extras/divider.png?t=1748948099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967630/extras/4_hours.png?t=1748948099\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>That sounds pretty reasonable in this day and age, right? You\u2019re busy, after all.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Biggleboss Incident is (hopefully) funny and entertaining and intriguing, and functions \u2013 for all intents and purposes \u2013 like a genuine video game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It doesn\u2019t push the genre forward or break any new ground or anything, but I\u2019ll leave that stuff to the pros. And, hey, if you ignore some of the rougher edges I\u2019ll forget all about that embarrassing thing you did that one time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You know the one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967630/extras/lobbygif3.gif?t=1748948099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Anyway, this is most definitely a point-and-click adventure video game, and it\u2019s one I think you should probably buy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967630/extras/divider.png?t=1748948099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voices!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pointing!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clicking!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intrigue and mystery!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mild peril!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A bit where you can flick a light switch that serves absolutely no purpose!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pervasive, crushing satire about the pointlessness of corporate culture!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2967630?t=1748948099","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967630/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748948099","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967630/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748948099","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967630/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748948099","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3653950,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967630/extras/90s.png?t=1748948099\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What boots up is an <u>UNDISCOVERED GEM</u>. A fun, funny point and click adventure that somehow merges <i>Monkey Island</i>, <i>Office Space</i>, and a smidge of <i>Metal Gear Solid</i>.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In The Biggleboss Incident, you\u2019ll solve puzzles, shirk responsibility, and figure out what\u2019s really happening behind the scenes in the world\u2019s weirdest office.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967630/extras/labgif3.gif?t=1748948099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s just like those adventure games you remember, only without the insane moon logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967630/extras/divider.png?t=1748948099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967630/extras/story.png?t=1748948099\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>There is NOTHING sinister happening at Biggleboss Inc.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or at least that\u2019s what the company motto says. Tom doesn\u2019t have time to debate semantics, though; he\u2019s dangerously late for work \u2013 and he hasn\u2019t even started his big Project AGER pitch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sneaking up to his desk won\u2019t be easy. In his way stands a boatload of bureaucracy, a furlong of fetch quests, and a pretty ominous set of warnings from a mysterious voice in the air vents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967630/extras/toiletgif3.gif?t=1748948099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just what is going on at Biggleboss Inc.?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What does it have to do with Tom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And why does it suddenly feel like his day is only set to get weirder?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967630/extras/divider.png?t=1748948099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967630/extras/voice_acting.png?t=1748948099\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>This game is fully voiced by real human beings who all got paid.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That's 13 actors playing some 18 characters. Why not see if you can guess which ones double up? I bet you can't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;This is the first script  I've recorded where I have genuinely laughed out loud all throughout the recording. In my 11 years of working as a voice actor I'd mark this down as <strong>the funniest project I've ever worked on</strong>.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0- <strong>Greg Johnson</strong> | The game's lead voice actor</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game's also packed with  lots of whizzy animations, cutscenes, and fun touches that took ages to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In fact this whole thing took me five years to make, so if you play it I sure hope you like it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967630/extras/divider.png?t=1748948099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967630/extras/4_hours.png?t=1748948099\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>That sounds pretty reasonable in this day and age, right? You\u2019re busy, after all.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Biggleboss Incident is (hopefully) funny and entertaining and intriguing, and functions \u2013 for all intents and purposes \u2013 like a genuine video game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It doesn\u2019t push the genre forward or break any new ground or anything, but I\u2019ll leave that stuff to the pros. And, hey, if you ignore some of the rougher edges I\u2019ll forget all about that embarrassing thing you did that one time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You know the one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967630/extras/lobbygif3.gif?t=1748948099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Anyway, this is most definitely a point-and-click adventure video game, and it\u2019s one I think you should probably buy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967630/extras/divider.png?t=1748948099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voices!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pointing!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clicking!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intrigue and mystery!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mild peril!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A bit where you can flick a light switch that serves absolutely no purpose!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pervasive, crushing satire about the pointlessness of corporate culture!</p></li></ul>","developers":["BUNKWORKS"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967630/1960793da214e5bf97d4e185d543808b1155c5e4/header.jpg?t=1748948099","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS 10.15+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Hardware Accelerated Graphics with dedicated memory<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257121700,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121700/movie480.mp4?t=1748877468","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121700/movie_max.mp4?t=1748877468"},"name":"The Biggleboss Incident | Release Date Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257121700/9fe1b992d9a37d47f1f28899e71461bdb5c33244/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748877468","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121700/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748877468","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121700/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748877468"}}],"name":"The Biggleboss Incident","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<b